            "review_title": "Review at Juice Oi Restaurant",
            "review_text": "MariaBirgit111\nGorinchem, The Netherlands23 contributions\n0\nMy favorite juice place\nMay 2017 • Solo\nI come here at least once a week to get a green juice or a salad. They exclusively use organic (imported) ingredients, which is such a win a country as Vietnam, where many chemicals are used. The ladies behind the counter are always friendly and helpful. The manager speaks very good English.\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten June 2, 2017",
            "rating": 5.0,
